			</View>
			<Placemark>
				<name>West Thumb Geyser Basin</name>
				<description>This is one of the more striking geothermal areas as it sits on the edge of the pristine mountain lake. Features here include fumaroles, the colorful Thumb Paintpots, Fishing Cone Geyser, and Lone Pine Geyser.</description>
