		<Folder>
			<name>Mammoth Hot Springs Area</name>
			<description><![CDATA[Park Headquarters are located here along with historic Fort Yellowstone, a visitor center and medical center, post office, stores, amenities, and camping. Bighorn sheep are often seen in this area and on the high terraces, greeting visitors arriving from the Park's north entrance. <a href="http://www.yellowstoneparknet.com/webcams/mammoth.php">Mammoth Webcam</a>]]></description>
