			<Placemark>
				<name>Old Faithful</name>
				<description><![CDATA[The most famous and most popular attraction at Yellowstone, Old Faithful erupts approx. every 80 minutes, spraying water and steam up to 184 feet for 1 to 5 minutes. Notes the crowds gathered here - it was just erupting when this shot was taken (or just has or will shortly.) <a href="http://www.nps.gov/yell/oldfaithfulcam.htm">Old Faithful webcam</a>]]></description>
